{"4148960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seven Scarecrows", "steam_appid": 4148960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You are lost in the shadows, the Loop Curse of the Seven Scarecrows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Memorize this first garden and look for anomalies in the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you find no anomalies, go further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you find anomalies, go back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">When you are right, one more Scarecrow will be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Seven Scarecrows will break the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4148960/extras/174e35faf82dd13d5302d10e4cbdf8fd.avif?t=1764605272\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>In shadowed fields, seven scarecrows stand,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Of ragged sack and bone, by curse command.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Entwined in loops of mystery profound,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>They wake and reap, in endless cycle bound.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locked in an eternal loop, in Seven Scarecrows you need to search carefully for anomalies in the Shadows, and decide your way for escaping the Scarecrow Curse. Will you go further or look back?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the quiet dusk of abandoned fields, an endless cycle u